{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8001_p", "source_sha256": "9993b635477e9c5194eb90a7aba35d59ee1453e055f34173b1650e581aa6aa70", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の新企画。\n撮影のテーマは、『闇の病院で働くナース』だ）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的新企划。\n拍摄主题是“在黑暗医院工作的护士”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8002_029umi", "source_sha256": "1d9037888bdff4f007eee7a5e9ab64da112ed6eeef2f5dd969fc187d06c6db14", "ja": "{$P$}！\nこの衣装、すっごくカワイイね♪　ありがとー！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n这身服装超级可爱呢♪ 谢谢啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8003_p", "source_sha256": "39d3a571f6d366292e2ae3ab1b398817a922eab84d3589e3390ca7a5bf3759dd", "ja": "気に入ってくれたみたいでよかった。ただ、\nテーマが少し特殊だけど……撮影は大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "你喜欢就好。不过，这个主题有点特别……拍摄没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8004_029umi", "source_sha256": "110bf111fa3984d314cba3b6131e43b727bca8dded4985d27d52494f8d8c31b7", "ja": "うん！　『闇の病院』ってどんな感じか悩んでたら、\n琴葉が「ヤンデレとか？」ってアドバイスくれたの。", "zh": "嗯！我正为“黑暗医院”该是什么感觉而烦恼时，琴叶给我建议说：“病娇之类的？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8005_p", "source_sha256": "c507d1e9bf73fa60fd1ed624835f93e137cacc1cba8ebdb8db9255d7caaf4c0d", "ja": "確かに。独特の設定だから濃い方がいいと思う。\nでも海美がヤンデレか……。", "zh": "确实。这个设定很独特，所以演得浓烈一点应该更好。\n不过海美来演病娇啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8006_029umi", "source_sha256": "8c65b26f4bcf87ff3bc166236318ff60b940d3c8264d4a17f102499b9b11ef99", "ja": "大丈夫！　結構自信はあるんだーっ！\n{$P$}ちょっと患者の役やってみて？", "zh": "没问题！我其实挺有自信的——！\n{$P$}你来演一下患者试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8007_p", "source_sha256": "98f8a92768775534233422fc57adcc3de30f5a94a25801d0ca1e097623cda9c7", "ja": "わかった。えーっと……。", "zh": "好，让我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8008", "source_sha256": "39db1745b89eb3cf76b3387eb52e61a8c925f807947023a1c39869c732c53d26", "ja": "退院日を聞く", "zh": "询问出院日期", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8009", "source_sha256": "9c1a354340db13caaa9b5e9530ed86240d90beaeddd28ecd95d3550516f826a0", "ja": "痛みを訴える", "zh": "诉说疼痛", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8010", "source_sha256": "f13aacb663aff4f1f5b4f991e343f156fefb159cf26f8fe5b641f4c04aa3174b", "ja": "すべてを諦める", "zh": "放弃一切", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8100_p", "source_sha256": "bb25184f7c85b0ecbca58da9c686273608594028cbf2cd954fedde70b5820073", "ja": "「あの、いつ退院できますか？\nもう良くなってると思うんですが……」", "zh": "「那个，我什么时候能出院呢？\n感觉已经好得差不多了……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8101_029umi", "source_sha256": "a06141c9ee5e74dcaa9e854bac79313ba19a97dbe3dd51dd7bb708f08b9d3ae4", "ja": "「うふふっ♪　退院なんてありえません。\nずっとずーっとこの病室で、私が看病するんですから」", "zh": "「呵呵呵♪　出院什么的根本不可能哦。\n因为我会在这间病房里，一直一直照顾您的」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8102_029umi", "source_sha256": "62b55fe7d9e2a4b88d3e3035d67e7134a7612ba645b076580715ae055b9acfb2", "ja": "「永遠に、私の愛に蝕まれてくださいね……」\n……こんなとこかな。えへへ、バッチリでしょ♪", "zh": "“请永远被我的爱侵蚀吧……”\n\n……差不多就是这样吧。嘿嘿，完美无缺，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8200_p", "source_sha256": "f51463e23601836d36a5e12ee7b0aad2f38504db01f108c59ce410bfe0994988", "ja": "「すみません。昨晩から喉が痛くて。\n見てもらえますか？」", "zh": "“不好意思。昨晚开始喉咙有点疼。\n能帮我看一下吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8201_029umi", "source_sha256": "d779197c37c60ce1f27c44e51531f32f8b3ff483839e010abb904d6a8d4cf74b", "ja": "「それは大変。今すぐ入院ですね♪」　……って、\nあれ？　これ、お医者さんの台詞だね！", "zh": "“那可严重了。必须马上住院呢♪”……等等，\n咦？这是医生的台词吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8202_029umi", "source_sha256": "bd8ccb6c13a3a224610a66b69b54a17ee08c2586e8b3a06403a5581fb718067b", "ja": "{$P$}、もっと練習したいから\n付き合って！　本番までには物にするぞー☆", "zh": "{$P$}，我还想多练习一会儿，陪我一起练吧！在正式演出前我一定要练会——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8300_p", "source_sha256": "6fd43892664beef1f6ce6dce7444a4f443f0078dbeb0e570030b6796e5084b74", "ja": "「もうこの病気は治らないんだ……。\nナースさん、そうなんでしょう？」", "zh": "「这病已经治不好了吧……\n护士小姐，是这样吧？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8301_029umi", "source_sha256": "0fc69ce8a289d7ee6f2be0fc334a486766c3d75f41b03e76c509e47d5de071df", "ja": "……そ、そんなことないよっ！\n絶対治る！　治るからあきらめないで～っ！", "zh": "……没、没那回事！\n绝对能治好！能治好的，所以别放弃啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_8302_029umi", "source_sha256": "03dc80221245ff238f990003643dc640006b32cb1883eae8e10bb70764162809", "ja": "ああっ！？　ごめん、{$P$}！\n失敗しちゃった……やり直しやり直し～っ！", "zh": "啊！？对不起，{$P$}！\n失败了……重来重来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
